    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Aneed's journey into nursing wasn't an obvious choice. Like many, he had his own misconceptions about the field, but it became a path he was drawn to over time. Encouraged by Aga Khan University (AKU) alumni, including his uncle, he began exploring the field and found his interest growing as he learned more. \"The more I explored, the more I understood the crucial role nursing plays in Pakistan's healthcare system,\" he reflects. \"I realized how important it is to have skilled nurses, especially in underserved areas.\"",
